<title>USA: Goshen Multi-School Building Corp, Ind., repriced.</title>
<headline>Goshen Multi-School Building Corp, Ind., repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AG Edwards &amp; Sons said it repriced a $39 million Goshen Multi-School Building Corp, Ind., first mortgage bond issue, Series 1996, raising yields on maturities in 2007, 2008, 2009, 2010 and 2011 by five basis points.</p>
<p>The yield in 2016 was cut to 5.82 percent from 5.85 percent.</p>
